# Response headers for every file of the app, applied by Cloudflare's static assets (wr.py ships this file).
# Nothing here limits what the app itself loads: the page is never shown inside another site's frame, the
# browser doesn't guess file types, and other sites are told only this origin, never a full address.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
